# CGE Sensor Test — Empty, Full Throttle
**Date:** 25/09/2026
**Location:** On-machine (Case IH 1480 clean grain elevator)
**Operator:** Mike Otto
**Firmware:** yield_monitor_bench v0.4 (phase1_bench line)
**Sensor position:** Mounted to actual CGE housing, beam across the 8" axis normal to grain flow

---

## Milestone summary

**First on-machine sensor test.** Emitter and receiver are physically mounted to the clean grain elevator (no longer a bench prototype). Test captured empty CGE at three operating states: mid-throttle idle → full throttle 2800 engine RPM → spin-down → off. Total 720 paddle events counted over ~126 seconds of active operation, with 2 garbled serial lines (~0.15% loss). Sensor and firmware confirmed working under real machine vibration and lighting conditions.

