## Observed paddle passing rate

Segmenting the log by machine state:

| Phase | Time range | Duration | Mean rate | Median | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Mid-throttle | t=3..41s | 39 s | 4.59 Hz | 5.0 Hz | Startup / partial throttle |
| **Full throttle (2800 RPM)** | **t=46..106s** | **61 s** | **7.23 Hz** | **7.0 Hz** | **Sustained, stdev 0.59 Hz** |
| Full-throttle range | — | — | 6.0 - 9.0 Hz | — | Peak 9 Hz |
| Spin-down | t=109..126s | 18 s | 3.22 Hz | 3.5 Hz | Rate decays 5 -> 4 -> 3 -> 2 -> 1 -> 0 |
| Off | t=127..154s | 28 s | 0.0 Hz | 0.0 Hz | Zero false counts |

**Headline number:** Empty CGE at 2800 engine RPM = **~7 Hz sustained paddle passing rate** (stdev 0.59 Hz across 61 s of steady-state operation).

